  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\field]\nDeclares: F ::= (X, +, *, 0, 1) is \\(commutative)::ring via (X, +, *, 0, 1)\nsatisfies:\n. 0 != 1\n. forAll: x \"in\" F\n  where: x != 0\n  then:\n  . exists: y \"in\" F\n    suchThat: x * y = 1\nEnables:\n. capability: x_ \"in\" F :<->: x_ is \\field.element:of{F}\n  written: \"x_? \\in F?\"\nDocumented:\n. called: \"field\"\n. description: \"A field is a commutative ring $(F, +, *, 0, 1)$ with $0 \\neq 1$\n                in which every non-zero element has a multiplicative inverse.\"\nId: \"53a76a9b-97d9-4c4d-b6c6-cc00983cfcb2\"",
